"""NLSY79 raw (1979 snapshot). Q: How is the Black-minus-NBNH advantage in BA/completion rates related to SES?
Design (approved): graded operationalization (BA>=16 descriptive; any-college>=13 + continuous HG79 = inference),
age>=20 anchor, NBNH comparison, SES composite (log income79 + mother/father ed) tertiles, complete-case primary,
multiple robustness checks. Deterministic (seed=42)."""
